#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:596
msgid "Erase Configuration Strategy: Select feature settings tokens via checkboxes across either list above to submit them for hard erasure. Applying the button action inside the footer below will permanently scrub the keys and clear out data structures directly from the WordPress database rows context allocations."
msgstr "Instellingen wissen: selecteer met de vinkjes in een van de lijsten hierboven de tokens die je wilt wissen. De knop hieronder verwijdert die opties en hun gegevens definitief uit de database."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:613
